* EHX 6H30Pi-EB, fit to archived official PDF. Generated by scripts/fit_tube.py
* Pins P G K; physical bottle mapping is in parts.exceptions.json; no circuit is generated here.
* W is a scenario emission multiplier, NOT a validated heater model.
.subckt H30 P G K params: SCALE=1 MUS=1 W=1
.param MU=12.68396438 EX=1.180911006 KG1=336.9557592 KP=75.32431427 KVB=1
BEP EP 0 V={max(V(P,K),0)/KP*ln(1+exp(min(80,KP*(1/(MU*MUS)+V(G,K)/sqrt(KVB+V(P,K)^2)))) )}
BIP P K I={SCALE*W*2*max(V(EP),0)^EX/KG1}
RPK P K 1G
RG G GX 2k
DGRID GX K DGRIDMOD
.model DGRIDMOD D(Is=1e-12 N=1.5)
CGK G K 6.3p
CGP G P 6p
CPK P K 2.4p
.ends H30
